      "id": "c2de215a-2b1a-4422-b1b8-2d3d8702a747",
      "name": "讀取現有週總結避免覆寫已審核文字",
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const clients=$('讀取所有 Clients').all().map(i=>i.json),meals=$('讀取所有 Meals').all().map(i=>i.json),existing=new Set($input.all().map(i=>String(i.json.summary_id||'')));\nconst asDate=s=>new Date(String(s||'').slice(0,10)+'T00:00:00Z');\nconst fmt=d=>d.toISOString().slice(0,10); const today=fmt(new Date(Date.now()+8*3600000));\n// 只在每位客戶課程起始日滿 7、14、...、56 天時產出新一週的總結。\nconst result=[];\nfor(const c of clients){\n if(!String(c.client_id||'').startsWith('TEST-'))continue;\n if(String(c.active||'').trim()!=='是'||!c.client_id||!c.course_start) continue;\n const days=Math.round((asDate(today)-asDate(c.course_start))/86400000);\n if(days<7||days>56||days%7!==0) continue;\n const weekNo=days/7, start=fmt(new Date(asDate(c.course_start).getTime()+(days-7)*86400000)),end=fmt(new Date(asDate(c.course_start).getTime()+(days-1)*86400000));\n const id='WEEK|'+c.client_id+'|'+weekNo;\n if(existing.has(id))continue;\n const eligible=meals.filter(r=>String(r.client_id)===String(c.client_id)&&r.meal_date>=start&&r.meal_date<=end);const m=[...new Map(eligible.map(r=>[String(r.meal_date)+'|'+String(r.meal_type),r])).values()];\n const daysWithLog=new Set(m.map(r=>r.meal_date));const expectedPerDay=Math.max(0,Number(c.daily_expected_meals)||0),goalTargetPerDay=Math.max(0,Number(c.daily_target_goal_meals)||0);\n const expected=expectedPerDay*7;const yes=m.filter(r=>String(r.coach_goal_met).trim()==='是').length,no=m.filter(r=>String(r.coach_goal_met).trim()==='否').length;\n const cov=expected?Math.min(100,Math.round(m.length/expected*100)):'';\n const goalTarget=goalTargetPerDay*7; const goalPct=goalTarget&&yes+no?Math.min(100,Math.round(yes/goalTarget*100)):'';\n const note=(daysWithLog.size<7?'本週有未上傳日期；':'')+(!goalTarget?'尚未設定可計數的目標；':yes+no===0?'缺少教練核實的目標判斷；':'目標達成率僅依教練核實為「是」的紀錄計算；未上傳不代表未達標。');\n const details=m.map(r=>[r.meal_date,r.meal_type,'餐點:'+String(r.meal_text||r.observed_foods||'未提供'), '教練核實:'+String(r.coach_goal_met||'待確認')].join(' / ')).slice(0,60).join('\\n');\n const prompt=['你是營養教練的內部八週追蹤輔助 AI。請用繁體中文總結個案第'+weekNo+'週('+start+' 至 '+end+')的飲食紀錄，對照其個人目標提供建議。','目標：'+String(c.goal_text||''),'具體追蹤指標：'+String(c.goal_rule||''),'本週記錄覆蓋率（不是減重達成率）：'+String(cov === '' ? '無法計算' : cov)+'%','依人工核實資料計算的目標進度：'+String(goalPct === '' ? '無法計算' : goalPct)+'%；'+note,'紀錄如下：\\n'+(details||'沒有上傳紀錄。'),'不得將未上傳推定為未達標、也不得推測體重變化或健康問題。請輸出 coach_summary（給教練，條列本週趨勢與缺失）與 ai_client_draft（給客戶約120-200字，正向且符合目標，僅為草稿）。'].join('\\n');\n const req={contents:[{parts:[{text:prompt}]}],generationConfig:{responseMimeType:'application/json',responseJsonSchema:{type:'object',properties:{coach_summary:{type:'string'},ai_client_draft:{type:'string'}},required:['coach_summary','ai_client_draft']}}};\n result.push({json:{summary_id:id,client_id:c.client_id,week_no:String(weekNo),week_start:start,week_end:end,goal_text:c.goal_text||'',expected_meals:String(expected),recorded_meals:String(m.length),coverage_pct:String(cov),goal_target_total:String(goalTarget),verified_goal_yes:String(yes),verified_goal_no:String(no),goal_achievement_pct:String(goalPct),metric_note:note,requestBody:req}});\n}\nreturn result;",
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems"
      },
